        "The fixture models dependency-aware teardown as a reverse ownership order: release the appointment before its user. It does not implement the Playwright fixture scheduler, execute database deletion or prove a production cleanup endpoint. Real integration checks must verify the intended create/delete contracts and the runner lifecycle, including failures before yielding to the test body."
