        "Deterministic seeds or explicit values make a synthetic case reproducible, but randomness is not a substitute for required boundary coverage. Deliberately include empty, minimum, maximum, duplicate and invalid values where the specification defines them. A generator that happens to create many typical orders can still miss a critical maximum-quantity boundary forever."
